<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh April unemployment steady at 4.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Kazakh April unemployment steady at 4.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's unemployment in April was unchanged at 4.2 percent of the workforce, the National Statistics Agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH UNEMPLOYMENT    April '97   March '97    April '96</p>
<p>    Number of unemployed   283,700     288,600	225,900</p>
<p>    Percent of workforce     4.2	   4.2	    n/a</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
